Spotify Music Recommendation System
Project Overview

Developed a personalized music recommendation system using Machine Learning techniques to recommend songs based on users' listening behaviour and audio features.
Objectives
- Analyze user listening behaviour.
- Understand music and audio feature patterns.
- Recommend songs based on user preferences.
- Improve personalization through recommendation techniques.
Technologies Used
- Python
- K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)
- Hybrid Filtering
- Machine Learning
- Data Analysis
Project Workflow
1. Data Collection: Collected music-related data and audio features.
2. Data Preprocessing: Cleaned and prepared the dataset.
3. Feature Analysis: Analyzed audio features and listening behaviour.
4. Model Development: Applied KNN and hybrid filtering techniques.
5. Recommendation: Generated personalized music recommendations.
Project Outcome
Built a personalized music recommendation engine using KNN and hybrid filtering based on listening behaviour and audio features.
